  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ASV mellan stiftelsen Chalmers Industriteknik, the Water Utility      Cooperation i Botswana och University of Botswana som syftar till att testa l&#xf6;sningar f&#xf6;r sanitets- och avloppshantering f&#xf6;r att skapa en   tydligare vision och strategi f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra h&#xe5;llbarheten i        Botswanas VA system.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PDC between Chalmers Industriteknik, the Water Utility Cooperation in Botswana and the University of Botswana that aims at testing          solutions for sanitation and wastewater management, with the purpose  of creating a clear vision and strategy for sustainable wastewater    management and sanitation in Botswana, that can be used for policy    input.</narrative>
  </description>
